WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.310
- Welcome back to the Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.860
I am your host for the
hour, Kumail Nanjiani.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.800
Kelly is out sick, so
I am in charge today,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.238
which means the show is a
Welcome to Chippendales Takeover!

00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:12.379
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.700
(upbeat band music)

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.280
We have even turned the
Blake Shelton box seats

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.080
into a small nightclub.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.227
Hey guys!
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:22.060
Yeah,

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.130
Yeah.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.010
Our first guest is the
woman who plays my wife

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.270
in the series.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.520
So see, Welcome to Chippendales
might seem like a show

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.353
about strippers,

00:00:30.353 --> 00:00:33.540
but at the center of
every great story is love.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.560
This woman is a crazy talented
actress, dancer, and singer.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.420
She's even won a Tony for her performance

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.836
in "You Can't Take It
With You" on Broadway.

00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:42.669
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:42.669 --> 00:00:44.477
Say hello to Annaleigh Ashford.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:49.310
(upbeat music)
(applause)

00:00:52.608 --> 00:00:56.525
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:01:03.224 --> 00:01:04.683
- Hello band! Yes!

00:01:04.683 --> 00:01:05.643
Hi!

00:01:05.643 --> 00:01:07.590
Yes, band! Yes.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:08.633
- How's it going?
- Hi!

00:01:08.633 --> 00:01:09.466
Hey buddy, how's it going?

00:01:09.466 --> 00:01:10.410
You're hosting a show!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:11.565
- I am.

00:01:11.565 --> 00:01:12.798
(audience claps and cheers)
- Who knew?

00:01:12.798 --> 00:01:13.631
- Yeah. It's weird.

00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:14.464
It's like,
(Annaleigh laughs)

00:01:14.464 --> 00:01:15.297
- [Annaleigh] It is.

00:01:15.297 --> 00:01:16.860
- You're on Kelly Clarkson, but I've,

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:17.910
- Yeah. Where is Kelly?

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:18.743
- [Kamal] She's,

00:01:18.743 --> 00:01:19.800
- And why are you here?

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.633
- I don't know.

00:01:20.633 --> 00:01:22.019
This is a nightmare you're having.

00:01:22.019 --> 00:01:23.818
- It's the Welcome to
Chippendales Takeover!

00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:25.490
- Yeah, it is. (laughs)

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:26.930
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.207
- Was there a band?
- It only works when I say it.

00:01:28.207 --> 00:01:30.279
Welcome to Chippendales Takeover.

00:01:30.279 --> 00:01:33.080
(upbeat band music)

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:33.913
(Annaleigh laughs)

00:01:33.913 --> 00:01:36.090
So you are like a really great dancer.

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.760
You're like a trained, stage dancer,

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.350
but what do you think of
the dancing on our show?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.271
What do you think of all
those guys over there?

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:43.104
- Oh, these
(audience cheers)

00:01:43.104 --> 00:01:44.193
I love you guys!

00:01:44.193 --> 00:01:45.660
(lips smack)

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.430
I mean, these boys are the best.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.840
I always like to tell everybody

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.310
that all of these sweet boys,

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.810
not only are they fierce at dancing,

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:54.420
but they are beautiful actors
who gave each of their boys

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.730
a story and a love and a life and a heart,

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.770
and like, I'm really proud
that we got to play with them.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:01:59.640
- [Kamal] Yeah.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.970
And they were so,
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.130
so wonderful to have on set too.

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:08.610
Always, it was like this
energy every day going to work.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:09.501
- Yes. Every day.

00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:10.334
- Hard to play.

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:12.660
You know, I realize we haven't
really talked about the show.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.460
Do you want to tell 'em
what the show's about

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.930
and who you are and all those things?

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:16.763
- Sure, sure, sure.

00:02:16.763 --> 00:02:17.596
- [Kamal] Do my job for me.

00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:18.833
- Okay, great, great.
(audience laughs)

00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:23.430
Well, what's I think super
special about this piece is,

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:26.520
yeah, we all know the
pop culture kind of magic

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.720
of the Chippendales dancers.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.700
We all just think of the boys,

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.860
and that's what you're gonna think of.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:35.250
But my mom is actually
a true crime aficionado,

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.280
so she enlightened me about the real story

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.020
of the Chippendales Dancers

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:43.020
and it was a true crime sensation.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.460
Hey, is this gluten free?
(audience laughs)

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:45.840
- I don't know if it's gluten free.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:46.673
Is it gonna?

00:02:46.673 --> 00:02:49.080
- Yeah, but here, I'll just
have a little whipped cream.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.130
That's,

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.270
Mm! Delicious!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.343
Was it in his pocket?

00:02:52.343 --> 00:02:53.567
- Yeah, it was in his pocket.

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:54.400
(audience laughs and applauds)

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.530
- Ooh, it's Banana-ey too!

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.520
- Yeah, it's got banana in it.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.290
- Oh, it's delicious.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.380
So yes, there's murder,
there is some mayhem,

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:04.410
there's a lot of love, there's
some very, very good dancing.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:09.090
But, I think it's gonna
be surprising how dynamic,

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:13.020
and I think beautiful the story is.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.450
- So you were a club dancer?

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.023
You're not, not like a strip,

00:03:17.023 --> 00:03:17.856
(audience laughs)

00:03:17.856 --> 00:03:18.689
not like,

00:03:18.689 --> 00:03:19.620
no,
(Annaleigh chuckles)

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.099
not a strip club dancer.

00:03:21.099 --> 00:03:22.140
(audience laughs)

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.300
But you were like a dancer in a club.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.940
- I was a go-go dancer,

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.527
doing interpretive dancing
at a 70s glam rock party.

00:03:30.527 --> 00:03:32.503
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:03:32.503 --> 00:03:35.280
Oh! That's me holding The Sweet album.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.052
- [Kamal] Can you still do those moves?

00:03:37.052 --> 00:03:41.730
- (clears throat) I mean,
my hip is a little older,

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.980
but you know, I can still throw down.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:44.909
- Can you prove it?

00:03:44.909 --> 00:03:47.777
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:03:47.777 --> 00:03:48.610
- I need the boys.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:49.878
Can I go up with the boys?

00:03:49.878 --> 00:03:50.711
Am I allowed to go?

00:03:50.711 --> 00:03:54.139
I used to dance on like a
platform, like where the boys are.

00:03:54.139 --> 00:03:55.140
- Why don't you do this?

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.310
Why don't you walk up there,

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.385
dance with them,
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:03:58.385 --> 00:03:59.495
and then I'll take us back,
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:03:59.495 --> 00:04:00.544
I'll give you time,
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:04:00.544 --> 00:04:02.580
and I'll take us out to a break, okay?

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.096
- But I'll wait for you to get up.

00:04:04.096 --> 00:04:04.929
Annaleigh Ashford.
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:04:04.929 --> 00:04:05.880
Look at her.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:06.990
It should take her.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.720
Use the stairs, Annaleigh. There you go.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.120
There's no elevator. This isn't the show.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.010
They don't carry you up the stairs here.

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.210
- Okay, you ready?

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:16.043
- Yeah. Here we go.

00:04:16.043 --> 00:04:17.790
We need to stop for
another commercial break.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.040
But we've got Murray Bartlett
from our Hulu series,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.450
Welcome to Chippendales,
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.620
joining us next!
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.743
Dancers and Annaleigh,
(upbeat band music)

00:04:23.743 --> 00:04:28.743
(Annaleigh laughs)
(audience applauds)

00:04:35.482 --> 00:04:36.315
- [Kamal] Wow!

00:04:36.315 --> 00:04:38.130
- [Murray] Hey, before we
start, can I try something?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:38.963
- [Kamal] Yes.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.460
- Hi, I'm Murray Bartlett,

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.846
and Welcome to Chippendales Takeover!

00:04:43.846 --> 00:04:46.493
(upbeat band music)
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:04:46.493 --> 00:04:48.150
- Yay!
- Okay, now it works!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.370
- Annaleigh, why don't you try it?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.664
- Welcome to the Chippendale's Takeover!

00:04:52.664 --> 00:04:57.384
(audience cheers)
(Murray and Kamal laugh)

00:04:57.384 --> 00:04:58.400
- Wait, too bad?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.300
- Wah, wah, wah, wah
- I don't know why

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.387
it doesn't work when you say,

00:05:01.387 --> 00:05:03.230
"Welcome to Chippendales Takeover?"

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:05.758
(upbeat band music)

00:05:05.758 --> 00:05:08.700
(Murray laughs)
(audience laughs and applauds)

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.130
Hey, it's great to be back
together, isn't it guys?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.360
- It is! It sort of feels,

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.860
I feel like I've woken up in a dream

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.900
where my brother is the
host of a talk show,

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.250
and I'm sitting next to my sister.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.083
- Oh
- Yeah.

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:18.930
- [Murray] What is happening?
(Annaleigh laughs)

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:19.763
Yeah

00:05:19.763 --> 00:05:20.760
- Hey, congrats on your Emmy!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.593
White Lotus.

00:05:21.593 --> 00:05:22.578
My God!
- Yeah!

00:05:22.578 --> 00:05:23.411
(audience cheers and applauds)
- Thank you, thank you.

00:05:23.411 --> 00:05:24.630
- So well earned!
- Thank you.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.187
Yeah
- Wow. So good.

00:05:26.187 --> 00:05:27.132
- Yeah, it was.

00:05:27.132 --> 00:05:30.780
It was a pretty epic
night that Emmy's night

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.360
because we shot White Lotus in the,

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.950
sort of the beginning of the pandemic,

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.130
and then we didn't really
see each other, that cast,

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:40.260
for a long period of time
'cause we were, you know,

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.460
thick in the pandemic.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.510
So the Emmy's night, when a
lot of the cast was nominated,

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.400
was one of the first times
we were all back together,

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.710
so it felt like this beautiful reunion,

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.090
and then, you know,

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:54.630
we were blessed to keep
winning awards that night,

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.870
so it was just this like sort
of ramping up of excitement

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:58.703
for all of us.

00:05:58.703 --> 00:05:59.854
It was really,
- Yeah, you won them all.

00:05:59.854 --> 00:06:00.687
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:06:00.687 --> 00:06:01.830
- [Murray] It was a bit
of a sweep, I have to say.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.663
Yeah, it was,

00:06:02.663 --> 00:06:03.540
- [Kamal] It was a bit of a sweep.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.440
Well deserved.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.423
- Thank you.

00:06:05.423 --> 00:06:06.256
- I mean, that show's fantastic,

00:06:06.256 --> 00:06:07.303
and you were so good in it.
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:06:07.303 --> 00:06:08.880
- Thank you.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.520
- I remember, I ran
into you at the airport

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:12.991
the very next day.

00:06:12.991 --> 00:06:13.824
- Yes.
- You did?

00:06:13.824 --> 00:06:14.993
- And you were just
there with your backpack,

00:06:14.993 --> 00:06:16.291
- Randomly.
- and I was like,

00:06:16.291 --> 00:06:17.124
yeah, I was like, "Where's your Emmy?"

00:06:17.124 --> 00:06:17.957
He's like, "I checked it."

00:06:17.957 --> 00:06:19.033
You checked your Emmy?
- You did?

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:19.866
(audience laughs)

00:06:19.866 --> 00:06:20.850
You didn't have it in your carry-on?

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:21.720
- [Kamal] No he didn't!

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:22.807
He just gave it to, like,

00:06:22.807 --> 00:06:24.607
"Put this in the bottom of the plane."

00:06:24.607 --> 00:06:26.340
(audience and Murray laughs)

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.650
Well, we had such a good time
on the sugar dance scenes,

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.964
you know, they had some real
like bachelorette party energy.

00:06:31.964 --> 00:06:33.690
Well, how did you guys feel, like,

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:34.530
during those dance scenes?

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.776
You choreographed them.

00:06:35.776 --> 00:06:37.010
(Annaleigh and Murray laugh)

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:37.886
I mean, your character.

00:06:37.886 --> 00:06:38.719
- Yeah.

00:06:38.719 --> 00:06:39.552
I pretended to.

00:06:39.552 --> 00:06:41.700
I mean, I remember, like,
I think we shot some

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.684
of those first Chippendales
Club scenes about a week

00:06:43.684 --> 00:06:46.650
into the shooting of the show.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:49.110
And so we were, you know,
in the sort of the flow

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.250
of doing scenes and stuff,

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.083
and it was great.

00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:52.140
I mean, it was great from the beginning,

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.360
but those days that we we started shooting

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:56.490
the Chippendales Club scenes,

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.880
I don't think we were
prepared for the intensity

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:04.810
of the kind of glee of the 200
plus like, background actors

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:10.680
it was especially
noticeable when, you know,

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.330
you have a bunch of background actors,

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.090
and they have to do
their actions sometimes

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:16.170
and not make the sound,

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.270
so the dancers come out,

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.525
and the background actors are all going

00:07:19.525 --> 00:07:21.660
(audience and Annaleigh laugh)

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.240
You know, all that kinda stuff,
but not making any sound.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:26.040
So, we were doing one of those takes,

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.380
and the dancers come
out, they do that thing,

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.450
and the background actors are, like,

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.890
and then they yelled, "Cut,"

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.225
and all the background
actors went "Waahhhh!"

00:07:34.225 --> 00:07:35.430
(Annaleigh and audience laugh)

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.540
There was this incredible,

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.190
and then when we were
shooting the coverage

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.560
when they were actually,
like, giving it full out,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.000
it lifted the roof off.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:42.833
Do you remember that?

00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:44.310
- Every single time we did,

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.980
every single time those guys danced,

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.980
people, the background, would go wild.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.300
- Yeah.
- They would, like, love it,

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.470
even though they weren't supposed to.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.380
They ruined takes because
they couldn't not squeal

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.940
when you guys ripped your pants off.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.500
That's gotta feel pretty good.
(audience laughs)

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.002
- But it was also like a
revelation for us, I think,

00:08:01.002 --> 00:08:04.050
of what it must have been like
in those Chippendales clubs.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.110
Like, there's something about
putting semi-naked people

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.580
in front of a bunch of other people

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.680
that just makes people go wild.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.513
Yeah, it was,

00:08:11.513 --> 00:08:13.867
- Yeah, it makes you go, "Oh,"
when you're not supposed to.

00:08:13.867 --> 00:08:15.293
(audience laughs)

00:08:15.293 --> 00:08:16.200
- Yeah, there's a lot of that.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.033
Yeah.

00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:19.020
- Up next, after the break,
we have Quentin Plair,

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:21.450
who is absolutely fantastic in the series.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.063
So we'll be right back.

00:08:23.063 --> 00:08:25.200
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.033
- Wow
- Hey!

00:08:26.033 --> 00:08:27.000
- [Quentin] Wait, hold on,
Kamal. Before we get started,

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.110
- [Kamal] Yeah.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.833
- You're hosting the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:08:29.833 --> 00:08:31.473
(Annaleigh and Murray laugh)
- Yeah, I am.

00:08:31.473 --> 00:08:34.473
- But, is it the Welcome
to Chippendales Takeover?

00:08:35.403 --> 00:08:38.220
(upbeat band music)

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.683
- [Kamal] Yeah. Wow.

00:08:39.683 --> 00:08:42.900
- This is the Welcome to
Chippendales Takeover!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.346
